---
/* Site footer, on every page via BaseLayout. Wording follows the marketing
   site's footer partial (site/src/partials/footer.html). The trader line is
   checked at build time, so keep its text exactly as is. */
---
<footer class="nuits-footer border-t border-border bg-card text-sm text-muted-foreground" aria-label="Site footer">
  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-5xl flex-col gap-3 px-4 py-8 md:px-6">
    <p class="text-foreground">
      <strong class="font-semibold">Nuits Receipts organises receipts and prepares a CSV for your accountant. It is not tax, VAT or accounting advice.</strong>
    </p>
    <p class="trader">Nuits, sole trader (Bapusaheb Shankaragouda Patil), Business ID 3584845-8, Helsinki, <a href="mailto:hi@brandnuits.com">hi@brandnuits.com</a></p>
    <p>Open source under the <a href="https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0">Apache License 2.0</a>.</p>
    <p>Holvi and other bank names are trademarks of their owners. Nuits Receipts is not affiliated with or endorsed by them.</p>
    <p>Cloudflare, the Cloudflare logo, and Cloudflare Workers are trademarks and/or registered trademarks of Cloudflare, Inc. in the United States and other jurisdictions.</p>
    <nav aria-label="Footer" class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-1">
      <a href="https://receipts.nuits.net/">Home</a>
      <a href="https://receipts.nuits.net/privacy/">Privacy notice</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</footer>

<style is:global>
  .nuits-footer a {
    color: var(--nb-foreground);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--nb-border-strong);
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  /* The two nav links stand alone: pad them to a 44px tap height without
     moving the row (the negative margin gives the space back). */
  .nuits-footer nav a {
    padding-block: 0.75rem;
    margin-block: -0.75rem;
  }
  .nuits-footer a:hover {
    text-decoration-color: var(--nb-brand);
  }
</style>
